    [
      "Original source cohort",
      [
        "The complete selected-analyte capture contains 943 records from station 21NC03WQ-H3200000, collected on 24 dates between 3 February 2011 and 11 December 2012. The ten public WQX3 fullPhysChem responses retain all original columns, identifiers, comments, sample fractions and detection limits. These queries have no date, sample-role or fraction filter.",
